WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.560
NovaCEE Offline for Nova, from Swipht Group.

00:04.250 --> 00:09.370
It brings API docs and developer tools into Nova, on Macs that never go online.

00:09.990 --> 00:12.340
Copy the payloads onto the machine ahead of time.

00:12.860 --> 00:17.210
Each one is checked against its SHA-256 hash before it installs.

00:17.820 --> 00:22.120
Search every installed docset from one palette, and read the page right in Nova.

00:22.710 --> 00:26.300
Library Health checks the manifest, the hashes, and the free space.

00:26.820 --> 00:33.660
Run the tools you brought along, again with the last arguments or a saved preset, and see how much disk each docset uses.

00:34.120 --> 00:35.840
It makes no network requests.

00:36.440 --> 00:40.160
Find NovaCEE Offline in the Nova Extension Library.
